
*.pyc
node_modules/
.vscode/settings.json
response_time.py
.env
cache/

# Mobile offline packs, built by build_packs.py.
#
# Deliberately not on main: they are tens of megabytes of data derived from
# stats/, they would push the Heroku slug up for files the dyno never reads,
# and a data-only change should not trigger a redeploy. They are published to
# the mobile-packs branch instead and fetched by the app straight from
# raw.githubusercontent.com -- the same arrangement as the replay-data branch.
stats/*/_packs/
